es more and quickler does not replace it. If the problem is drivers not completing the walkaround because the app is friction, quickler removes the app because they already use WhatsApp. One thing to check: whatever you use, confirm the walkaround output meets DVSA record-keeping expectations for your operation. See <a href=\"/pages/goaudits-alternative-uk.html\">GoAudits alternative UK</a> and <a href=\"/pages/alternatives.html\">all comparisons</a>.</p>"},{"kind":"faq","heading":"Questions, answered","html":"<h3>Does Quickler replace FleetCheck?</h3><p>No, and we will not pretend it does. FleetCheck is a full fleet-management system: MOT and tax reminders, driver records, defect management, whole-fleet admin. Quickler only does the on-site capture: the driver's daily DVSA walkaround in WhatsApp. If you need fleet management, keep FleetCheck.</p><h3>What does Quickler actually do for fleet compliance?</h3><p>One thing, well. It puts the daily driver walkaround in WhatsApp, so the driver replies to each check as a message and sends photos of any defect, producing a timestamped report. There is no app to install and no login. It solves the problem of drivers skipping the walkaround because opening an app is friction. It does not manage the wider fleet.</p><h3>Can I use Quickler alongside FleetCheck?</h3><p>Yes, and some firms do. FleetCheck handles the fleet admin, reminders, records and defect workflows, while quickler handles the on-site walkaround capture in WhatsApp. They address different parts of the job, so running both is a reasonable setup if driver adoption of the walkaround is your weak point.</p><h3>Is Quickler cheaper than FleetCheck?</h3><p>They are priced for different jobs, so a direct comparison is misleading. FleetCheck is priced around fleet size and modules; check their current page. Quickler is £20 per active user a month, where an active user is someone who completed at least two workflows that month, and dormant users are free. Quickler costs less because it does less: only the capture. Related: <a href=\"/pages/goaudits-alternative-uk.html\">GoAudits alternative UK</a> and <a href=\"/pages/alternatives.html\">all comparisons</a>.</p>"}],
